window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The gruffest, growliest, most elusive Hot Scot is about to meet his match.<br> <br> Never talk to a naked man in the woods. I learned that lesson when my solo kayaking trip in the Wyoming wilderness turned into a disaster. The Scottish beast who saved me insists on taking me back to his cabin, where there's no cell service and no one around for miles. And his car is broken. My savior has a deliciously hot body, but I don’t like men with long hair and scruffy beards.<br> <br> He's known as Munro \"Wild Man\" MacTaggart. That's just a goofy nickname, right? Um, not quite....<br> <br> A woman has invaded my sanctuary. Natalie Saari never stops talking. I don't care if she's bonnie and sexy and I'd love to shag her. After giving up on my career as a river guide, I only wanted to be left alone. What will I do to get rid of Natalie? Whatever it takes. But a storm strands us in my cabin, and soon, things get a wee bit out of hand.<br> <br> And now, the lass who despises me is about to realize just how wild I can get.</p> <p><i>Wild in a Kilt</i> is the 13th book in the best-selling Hot Scots series of contemporary romances.</p>"; 
